he standard variant is listed so an ordinary Leopard Man can be chosen. || Shaman variant: its skills are added by the variant; the removal of Secondary, Piloting and modern W.P. skills, the prayers and the Shaman XP ladder are prose only; see BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F108."
